From: PS5_Proton
Subject: [PATCH] graphics: retain GPU HWND planes with owner-bound helper identity

Reuse canonical WSI fences and display pacing. Bind actual owner-spawned PID
and actual Wine HWND generation; compose retained GPU client pixels with GDI
frames and canonical clips. Legacy standalone display clients remain unbound.

